@startuml UseCase2_View_Halal_Status_Activity

title View Halal Status of a Product

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #555555
  ArrowColor #333333
}

|User|
start
:Select product;

|System|
:Check assessment-results database
for a stored halal assessment;

if (Stored assessment exists?) then (yes)
  :Retrieve stored assessment;
else (no)
|External Product Data Sources|
:Provide required product data;

|System|
:Normalise selected product data
to the canonical assessment format;
note right
  Certifications
  Ingredients
  Manufacturer
  Country of Origin
end note
:Run halal assessment pipeline;

  if (Assessment completed?) then (yes)
    :Store assessment result
    in assessment-results database;
  else (no)
    :Inform user that a confirmed
    assessment cannot be produced;
    stop
  endif
endif

:Prepare product details, halal status,
and supporting justification;

|User|
:View product details and
halal assessment;
stop

@enduml
